  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5301.14 \"Knowledge test\" means a written or electronic knowledge evaluation to be completed by each student in order to successfully pass a motorcycle rider education program course.\n\nSource. #8403, eff 8-2-05; ss by #10589, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14174, eff 1-17-25",
